  "ocr_text": "DATE\nNUMBER\nSIGN GROUP,INC.\n7139 Dublin Boulevard  Dublin, California 94568\nPhilip Morris, USA\n510/828-5943\nDecember 21, 1995\n120 Park Avenue\nInvoice #1070-R\nNew York, NY 10017\nLocation:\nCandlestick Park,\nAttn: MR. GARY CAPREOL\nSan Francisco, CA\nCANDLESTICK PARK, SAN FRANCISCO, CALIFORNIA\nAMOUNT\nBilling for the manufacture and installation of the following advertising panels for\nMarlboro completed prior to September 1, 1995.\nPanel Sizes and Locations:\n1. Manufacture of 4'10\" x 25' soft face ad panels, aluminum\nextrusion flex face sign frames typical of Candlestick Park\nstandards.\n$3,975.00\nSales Tax (San Francisco County, 8.5%)\n337.88\n2. Installed twelve (12) 4' x 4' (46\" x 46\" live copy area) backlit\nnew concourse \"You Are Here\"signs furnished by Leo Burnett.\nLabor to receive from Crystal Plastics, pick up, uncrate and install.\n$1,420.00\n3. Install two (2) 4'10\"x 25 soft face ad panels, stretch or\naluminum extrusion frame and reinstall onright field and\nhome plate/third base line location. (Labor to install.)\n$1,760.00\n4. White out one (1)14'x 40' Left Field, MainScoreboard Ad\nPanel and two (2) 3'X 24Field Level Signs as per instructions\nto paint out all copy, set up; ete.\nfrom Virginia Murphy, Legal Department, Philip Morris. Labor\nL\n$1.430.00\nPLEASE MAKE CHECK PAYABLE TO\nSport USA Sign Group, Inc.\n2084061504\n7139 Dublin Boulevard\nDublin, CA 94568\niyk\nTotal Due\n$8.922.88\nSUSAs Federal ID #68-0307639\n5\nน",
